# Python bytecode and tool caches. chezmoi does NOT read .gitignore, so these
# need rules of their own: running any managed .py from the source tree (or a
# stray `python -m py_compile`) drops a __pycache__ beside it, and without this
# chezmoi treats that as a file to deploy. It did — ~/.local/lib/__pycache__
# was a deployed copy of the bytecode for .local/lib/kion_aws_cache_lock.py.
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache
**/.ruff_cache/**
